  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><p>24007260_PLN_LOC_1.1 - Site Location Plan - 25/02/2025<br>24007260_PLN_SI_2.1 - Proposed Site Plan - 25/02/2025<br>24007260_PLN_EL_3.1 - Elevation Plan - 25/02/2025<br>Street Hub Anti-Social Behaviour Management Plan - 18/11/2024<br>Street Hub Noise Management Plan - February 2025</p><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "The management of noise associated with the street hub shall be in accordance with the BT Street Hub Noise management Plan V2.1 dated February 2025 which was submitted in support of the application.",
    "This Street Hub must be managed in accordance with the agreed Version 3 of the BT Street Hub ASB Management Plan and must include the ongoing use of an algorithm to identify repeated anti-social number use, with a review after the first three months of installation between police and BT to assess any issues arising. Any change to the ASB management plan should be approved by the local planning authority and the Metropolitan Police Designing Out Crime Team. The ASB management plan must remain for the lifetime of the device."
  ],
